XMMS - X Multimedia System
==========================

This file credits everyone who has contributed to XMMS.

The original XMMS project was created in 1997 and its upstream development
ended with the 1.2.11 release in 2007. The original http://www.xmms.org
website and its @xmms.org contact addresses are no longer active.

This is a community-maintained fork (https://github.com/tuunanet/xmms-gtk2)
that keeps XMMS building and running on modern systems. The people listed
below under "Original XMMS authors and contributors" are the ones who
actually designed, built, documented, and shaped XMMS. Their work is the
foundation of everything in this repository, and this fork exists only to
keep that work usable. We honor and thank them.

The original contact addresses are preserved for the historical record only;
they are no longer valid. For this fork, please use the GitHub issue tracker:
https://github.com/tuunanet/xmms-gtk2/issues


